equipe"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A lecture transcript","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Lecture: Making Plans Go Right","paras":["Good morning. Today I will explain how plans **go** wrong, and how to make them **go** well. First, **go** step by step. Second, if something **goes** wrong, don’t **go** pale: **go** back and check.","I **intend** to share three tools. Many people **go** on a trip without a plan, and things **go** badly. Let’s **go** over the basics."],"kicker":"LECTURE","by":"Prof. Diaz","gloss":[]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The lecture is about plans.","ans":"T","why":"plans go wrong."},{"q":"The speaker intends to share five tools.","ans":"F","why":"three tools."},{"q":"You should go back and check.","ans":"T","why":"go back and check."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“intend” = ?","opts":["pretender","entender","intenso"],"ans":0,"why":"intend."},{"q":"“go wrong” = ?","opts":["dar errado","ir errado","estar errado"],"ans":0,"why":"go wrong."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Key verb: go","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Sentido","Exemplo"],"rows":[["ir","**go to work**"],["dar certo/errado","**go well / go wrong**"],["tornar-se","**go pale, go bad**"],["funcionar","**This machine goes by battery.**"],["go + -ing","**go shopping / go running**"]],"cap":"Key verb: go"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Passado **went**, particípio **gone**: *She has gone* (foi e não voltou) × *been* (foi e voltou)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"Plans can ___ wrong. (go)","a":"go","why":"go wrong."},{"s":"She ___ to work yesterday. (go, past)","a":"went","why":"go-went."},{"s":"I ___ to share three tools. (intend)","a":"intend","why":"intend to."},{"s":"Let’s ___ over the basics. (go)","a":"go","why":"go over."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["plan failure","fracasso do plano"],["step by step","passo a passo"],["three tools","três ferramentas"],["lecture hall","auditório"],["project plan","plano de projeto"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["go","well","Did","the","plan"],"ans":"Did the plan go well","pt":"O plano deu certo?"},{"words":["intend","to","do","What","do","you"],"ans":"What do you intend to do","pt":"O que pretende fazer?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"plan failure","pos":"word","pt":"fracasso do plano","ex":"Plan failure.","expt":"Fracasso do plano."},{"w":"step by step","pos":"word","pt":"passo a passo","ex":"Step by step.","expt":"Passo a passo."},{"w":"three tools","pos":"word","pt":"três ferramentas","ex":"Three tools.","expt":"Três ferramentas."},{"w":"project plan","pos":"word","pt":"plano de projeto","ex":"Project plan.","expt":"Plano de projeto."},{"w":"work trip","pos":"word","pt":"viagem de trabalho","ex":"Work trip.","expt":"Viagem de trabalho."},{"w":"bad planning","pos":"word","pt":"mau planejamento","ex":"Bad planning.","expt":"Mau planejamento."},{"w":"check list","pos":"word","pt":"lista de verificação","ex":"Check list.","expt":"Lista de verificação."},{"w":"time frame","pos":"word","pt":"prazo","ex":"Time frame.","expt":"Prazo."},{"w":"risk factor","pos":"word","pt":"fator de risco","ex":"Risk factor.","expt":"Fator de risco."},{"w":"backup plan","pos":"word","pt":"plano B","ex":"Backup plan.","expt":"Plano B."},{"w":"key step","pos":"word","pt":"passo-chave","ex":"Key step.","expt":"Passo-chave."},{"w":"clear target","pos":"word","pt":"alvo claro","ex":"Clear target.","expt":"Alvo claro."},{"w":"project goal","pos":"word","pt":"meta do projeto","ex":"Project goal.","expt":"Meta do projeto."},{"w":"planning tool","pos":"word","pt":"ferramenta de planejamento","ex":"Planning tool.","expt":"Ferramenta de planejamento."},{"w":"work calendar","pos":"word","pt":"calendário de trabalho","ex":"Work calendar.","expt":"Calendário de trabalho."},{"w":"small detail","pos":"word","pt":"pequeno detalhe","ex":"Small detail.","expt":"Pequeno detalhe."},{"w":"final check","pos":"word","pt":"conferência final","ex":"Final check.","expt":"Conferência final."},{"w":"team briefing","pos":"word","pt":"reunião de equipe","ex":"Team briefing.","expt":"Reunião de equipe."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Go the extra mile.** — Fazer um esforço extra.","**Go with the flow.** — Seguir o fluxo.","**It’s going to be fine.** — Vai dar tudo certo.","**Did the plan go well?** — O plano deu certo?","**No, it went wrong at the start.** — Não, deu errado no início.","**What do you intend to do?** — O que pretende fazer?","**The best of both worlds.** — O melhor dos dois mundos.","**Throw in the towel.** — Desistir."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"intend","pt":"pretender","forms":[["I / you / we / they intend","I intend to call."],["he / she / it intends","Pretendo ligar."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"After the lecture","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"After the lecture","lines":[["Ana","Did the plan go well?","O plano deu certo?"],["Leo","No, it went wrong at the start.","Não, deu errado no início."],["Ana","What do you intend to do?","O que pretende fazer?"],["Leo","I intend to go back and check.","Pretendo voltar e conferir."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Sentence stress","items":[{"label":"Sentence stress","note":"Na frase, acentue palavras de conteúdo (substantivos, verbos, adjetivos) e reduza as funcionais: I WANT to LEARN ENglish.","words":["I want to learn English.","She has studied for years.","Can you help me?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Use go + -ing.","pt":"Use.","model":"I go running on Sundays."},{"q":"Say something went well.","pt":"Diga.","model":"The meeting went well."},{"q":"State an intention.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I intend to finish today."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with go in different meanings.","model":"I go to work by bus. The meeting went well. Plans can go wrong. I go running on Sundays. I intend to go back and check.","checklist":["Usei **go/went**","Usei **intend to**","5 frases"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “plan failure” mean?","opts":["passo a passo","fracasso do plano","auditório"],"ans":1,"why":"**plan failure** = fracasso do plano."},{"q":"What does “step by step” mean?","opts":["três ferramentas","plano de projeto","passo a passo"],"ans":2,"why":"**step by step** = passo a passo."},{"q":"What does “three tools” mean?","opts":["três ferramentas","auditório","viagem de trabalho"],"ans":0,"why":"**three tools** = três ferramentas."},{"q":"What does “lecture hall” mean?","opts":["plano de projeto","auditório","mau planejamento"],"ans":1,"why":"**lecture hall** = auditório."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}